{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112896","id":3019425533,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6z-Mb9","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112896","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112896.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112896.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112896","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112896/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112896/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112896/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/d35fda8f819df5206dead5c696251a906f9a8c62","number":112896,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Optimize `Node.find_children` by 24%","user":{"login":"Joy-less","id":65855333,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1ODU1MzMz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65855333?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less","html_url":"https://github.com/Joy-less","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I optimized the performance of recursive `find_children` by 24%. Currently, it creates a new array for each descendant, only to append each descendant to the original array. This pull request makes it use the same array, using a lambda function.\r\n\r\nBenchmark:\r\n```gdscript\r\nextends Node3D\r\n\r\nfunc _ready()->void:\r\n\twhile true:\r\n\t\tbench_old()\r\n\t\tbench_new()\r\n\t\tawait get_tree().process_frame\r\n\r\nfunc bench_old()->void:\r\n\tvar start:float = Time.get_unix_time_from_system()\r\n\tvar results:Array[Node]\r\n\tfor i:int in 100_000:\r\n\t\tresults = find_children_old(\"*\")\r\n\tvar end:float = Time.get_unix_time_from_system()\r\n\tprint(\"old: \", (end - start) * 1000, \"ms\")\r\n\tresults.clear()\r\n\r\nfunc bench_new()->void:\r\n\tvar start:float = Time.get_unix_time_from_system()\r\n\tvar results:Array[Node]\r\n\tfor i:int in 100_000:\r\n\t\tresults = find_children(\"*\")\r\n\tvar end:float = Time.get_unix_time_from_system()\r\n\tprint(\"new: \", (end - start) * 1000, \"ms\")\r\n\tresults.clear()\r\n\r\n```\r\nResult:\r\n```gdscript\r\nold: 839.999914169312ms\r\nnew: 636.000156402588ms\r\nold: 832.000017166138ms\r\nnew: 635.999917984009ms\r\nold: 833.000183105469ms\r\nnew: 638.000011444092ms\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis means each benchmark call used to take `0.0084ms` but now takes `0.00636ms`.\r\n\r\nThe benchmarks were run in-editor with 41 descendants that I created and scattered randomly to emulate a real scene tree.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","des